    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-nŭmĕro</span></b> ,
			āre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to number with</i> something, <i>to reckon among</i> (post-class. and rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem inter liberos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					1, 5, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virum heroicis ingeniis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 25, 4, 1</span></i>
			.— <b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quemadmodum connumeratis et dicitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 2, 187</span></i>
			; Gai <i><span class="en">Inst. 1, 2, §
		4</span></i>.</div>
